  heroes  pending
  go      goqu.SelectDataset.Distinct with columns
  rust    SelectStatement::distinct_on
  python  Select.distinct with columns (PostgreSQL)

capability build/identifiers  a table's or a column's name quoted, a qualified name as its parts
  heroes  sql/build.column, sql/build.table, sql.quote_identifier
  go      goqu.I, goqu.C, goqu.T, goqu.S, exp.ParseIdentifier, exp.NewIdentifierExpression, exp.IdentifierExpression
  rust    sea_query::Alias, Iden, ColumnRef, TableRef, types::is_static_iden
  python  sqlalchemy.quoted_name, sqlalchemy.column, sqlalchemy.table, sqlalchemy.literal_column
  note    every name is quoted, always, by `sql.quote_identifier`; squirrel quotes nothing, goqu quotes, SQLAlchemy quotes only where a name needs it. A name given as text is cut at its dots into its parts

