capability build/limit-offset  a page of rows: at most so many, after so many
  heroes  sql/build.Select (`limit`, `offset`)
  go      squirrel.SelectBuilder.Limit, Offset, RemoveLimit, RemoveOffset, goqu.SelectDataset.Limit, LimitAll, Offset, ClearLimit, ClearOffset
  rust    SelectStatement::limit, offset, reset_limit, reset_offset
  python  Select.limit, Select.offset, Select.fetch, Select.slice
  note    both are parameters, as SQLAlchemy binds them; SQLite reads no OFFSET without a LIMIT, so an offset alone is written `LIMIT -1 OFFSET ?2` there, as SQLAlchemy does with a parameter

